<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
<p>BULKERS.</p>
<p>CSK Brilliance - (built 1981) 134,176 dwt sold for $11.6 million.</p>
<p>Bacesti - (built 1985) 65,418 dwt sold for $8 million.</p>
<p>Deerpool - (built 1982) 65,163 dwt sold for $10.25 million.</p>
<p>Schubert - (built 1973) 61,767 dwt sold for $2.8 million.</p>
<p>Salinas - (built 1985) 23,532 dwt sold for $8 million with two years timecharter attached at $6,200 daily.</p>
<p>Mile Kim - (built 1984) 23,100 dwt sold for $8  million.</p>
